  },
  "runtime_profile_assessment": {
    "assessment": "Appropriate for a Data/sql REQ. The candidate is profile-neutral and does not introduce AWS/on-prem business divergence. No runtime/bootstrap pollution is evident. PostgreSQL-specific features used here are consistent with the stated PostgreSQL 16/Alembic strategy."
  },
