    "test_migration_smoke.py expects index names and structures that the migration does not create (for example ix_documents_metadata_gin, ix_documents_search_vector_gin, ix_extracted_fields_metadata_gin, ix_ai_queries_metadata_gin), so the claimed smoke evidence is not believable.",
    "README_REQ-001.md and KIT_REQ-001.md still describe the wrong reserved-state model and therefore do not satisfy their declared purpose as truthful promotion/readiness documentation.",
